  "truth_boundary": "This lane validates only the exact pinned libadm build, its upstream unit tests, and bounded ADM XML create/parse/write behavior. It does not prove Aurora runtime ADM ingestion, BW64 audio integration, renderer semantics, S-ADM support, exhaustive ITU-R BS.2076 compliance, ITU-R BS.2127 rendering, protected-service interoperability, physical output, or certification."
